`,(0,n.jsxs)(r.ul,{children:[`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.li,{children:"Set the pace goal that will tell you, month by month, whether you’re on the way there: which groups should be active by when, and what breadth and depth would count as on track versus behind."}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.li,{children:"Make the pace goal concrete against a signal you’ll actually be able to read. “Every granted group returning weekly within eight weeks” is a pace; “good adoption soon” is a wish."}),`
`,(0,n.jsx)(r.li,{children:"Choose one group you’d most expect to lag, and decide now what a flat number there would prompt you to do first."}),`
